{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46167","headline":"东阳罹乱後怀王慥使君五首 一 · 贯休","name":"东阳罹乱後怀王慥使君五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨来祗对汉诸侯，胜事消磨不自由。\n裂地鼓鼙军□急，连天烽火阵云秋。\n砍毛淬剑虽无数，歃血爲盟不到头。\n谁爲今朝奉明主，使君司户在隋州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}